gctx is a CLI tool to manage multiple GCP accounts with
automatic switching of both gcloud configurations and ADC credentials.

Usage:
  gctx [command]

Available Commands:
  active      Show or set currently active account
  completion  Generate completion script
  create      Create a new account configuration
  delete      Delete an account
  env         Print shell exports that select an account
  help        Help about any command
  info        Show detailed account information
  list        List all configured accounts
  login       Re-authenticate an existing account
  run         Run a gcloud command with specific account
  save        Save current ADC credentials for an account
  shell       Start a new shell with specific account context
  switch      Switch to a different account
  tui         Interactive terminal UI
  version     Print the version number of gctx

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for gctx

Use "gctx [command] --help" for more information about a command.
